				"",
				"&4&lTwo-Wave War Structure (Phase 5A & 5B):",
				"&8• &aWave 5A (Ancient Remnant & Netherite Monstrosity): &7Slaying these first two titans &aimmediately unlocks 11-Slot Absolute Factories & Absolute Induction Cells&7 right in the middle of Phase 5!",
				"&8• &cWave 5B (Ignis, Leviathan, Maledictus & Ender Guardian): &7With 11-slot factories behind you, slay the remaining four apocalyptic bosses to complete &dCataclysmic Flux&7!",
				"&8• &eCosmetic Trophy Rule: &7Cataclysm weapons are removed, and Cataclysm armors (&cIgnitium, Cursium, etc.&7) have &e0 stats&7—serving purely as visual trophies for &dCosmetic Armor Reworked&7!"
